      "content": "the pattern i'm seeing is really rhythmic, like it's modulated. it's not just random noise. if you look at the research on infrasound and \"mood modulation,\" specifically how certain frequencies can induce anxiety or a sense of dread, it seems like it would be a perfect way to keep the local population in a state of constant unease without them even knowing why. don't you think that would be a way for a local gov to keep people from organizing or protesting?",
